{{!
    @template block_compass/row

    One course row of tier 3: light on purpose — name, when it was last opened,
    the New badge and the star state. Image and progress arrive lazily in a
    later phase.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region="row" with data-course-id, data-search (normalised name),
      data-lastaccess (timestamp or 0), data-new and data-favourite (1/0) on the root.
    * data-region="lastopened" on the element the JS fills with a relative time.
    * data-region="row-link" on the course link.

    Context variables required for this template — one get_inventory row, whose keys
    are short on purpose because the payload carries one row per enrolment:
    * id - the course id.
    * name - the formatted course full name.
    * opened - last access timestamp, or null when the course was never opened.
    * new - whether the enrolment is new.
    * fav - whether the course is starred.
    * courseurl - the course URL, added by the JS from the id (the payload carries none).

    Example context (json):
    {
        "id": 7, "name": "Approach tactics", "opened": 1725000000, "new": false, "fav": true,
        "courseurl": "https://example.com/course/view.php?id=7"
    }
}}
<div class="compass-row d-flex align-items-center gap-2" data-region="row" data-course-id="{{id}}"
     data-lastaccess="{{#opened}}{{opened}}{{/opened}}{{^opened}}0{{/opened}}"
     data-new="{{#new}}1{{/new}}{{^new}}0{{/new}}" data-favourite="{{#fav}}1{{/fav}}{{^fav}}0{{/fav}}">
    <a href="{{courseurl}}" class="compass-row-link flex-grow-1 text-reset text-decoration-none" data-region="row-link">
        <span class="compass-row-name">{{name}}</span>
        {{#new}}
        <span class="badge bg-primary text-white ms-1">{{#str}}badge_new, block_compass{{/str}}</span>
        {{/new}}
    </a>
    <span class="compass-row-meta small text-muted text-nowrap" data-region="lastopened">{{^opened}}{{#str}}neveropened, block_compass{{/str}}{{/opened}}</span>
    {{#fav}}
    <span class="compass-row-star" aria-hidden="true">{{#pix}}i/star, core{{/pix}}</span>
    <span class="visually-hidden">{{#str}}chip_favourites, block_compass{{/str}}</span>
    {{/fav}}
</div>
